WEBVTT

00:08:28.701 --> 00:08:30.020
and using calories.

00:08:30.044 --> 00:08:32.482
And as you come over
toward the side of the boat --

00:08:32.506 --> 00:08:34.846
not allowed to touch it,
not allowed to get out,

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:37.000
but Bonnie and her team hand me nutrition

00:08:37.024 --> 00:08:40.353
and ask me how I'm doing, am I all right.

00:08:40.377 --> 00:08:43.236
I am seeing the Taj Mahal --

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.481
(Laughter)

00:08:44.505 --> 00:08:45.788
Over here.

00:08:45.812 --> 00:08:49.575
I'm in a very different state --

00:08:49.599 --> 00:08:50.971
(Laughter)

00:08:50.995 --> 00:08:53.757
And I'm thinking, "Wow!

00:08:53.781 --> 00:08:57.370
I never thought I'd be running
into the Taj Mahal out here.

00:08:57.663 --> 00:08:59.424
It's gorgeous!

00:08:59.448 --> 00:09:02.037
I mean, how long
did it take them to build that?